"EasyMDE is a Markdown editor plugin built for WordPress. It provides "
"Markdown source editing, split-pane live Preview, local runtime assets, and "
"WordPress-native media, revisions, permissions, saving, and publishing."
msgstr ""
"EasyMDE 是一款为 WordPress 打造的 Markdown 编辑器插件。它提供 Markdown 源码"
"编辑、分屏实时预览、本地运行资源，以及 WordPress 原生媒体、修订版本、权限、"
"保存和发布能力。"

