"Export a JSON backup and import it into a compatible EasyMDE version."
msgstr "导出 JSON 备份，并在兼容的 EasyMDE 版本中导入。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:782
msgid ""
"Deliver the ordinary editor through React 18, strict TypeScript, and Vite."
msgstr "普通编辑器由 React 18、严格 TypeScript 和 Vite 交付。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:783
msgid ""
"Preserve source and Preview, themes, media, drafts, clipboard, and WeChat "
"export."
msgstr "保留源码与预览、主题、媒体、草稿、剪贴板和微信导出。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:784
msgid ""
"Keep publishing, taxonomies, featured media, and revisions WordPress-native."
msgstr "发布、分类法、特色媒体和修订版本继续使用 WordPress 原生界面。"

